+  source: "Source/bgp212.pdf: Table 3 (p. 39), Lemma 9.1 (p. 41), (10.1), Lemma 10.1, Proposition 10.2 (pp. 41–42), §11 (B₂₁, p. 42)"
+  builds_on: "V2b (supportT, indicator_supportT, integral_Qset, integral_fibred, weighted_simplexF, shifted_weighted, gramFormula), V1 (simplex_integral), V0 (gen, genIdx, B21Idx), A1 (BGP212.Params); A0–V2b unchanged"
+
+state:
+  mathematical: proved
+  computational: kernel-verified
+  provenance: pinned
