+  unproved_assumptions: "none (axioms: propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice)"
+  outside_V2c: >
+    the 846 × 846 matrix (not generated); J_T and the marginal fibres of Lemma 9.2; the §9.3
+    rescaling to the physical support; P⋆ and Theorem 11.1; the cap question of V2a (every
+    statement is parametrized by C; the Table 3 instances use BGP212.Params.C explicitly).
+
+verification:
+  definitions: BGP212/GramGeneral.lean
+  challenge: Challenge/GramGeneral.lean
+  solution: [Solution/GramGeneral.lean, Solution/GramGeneralCert.lean]
+  comparator_config: Comparator/gram_general_v2c.json
+  certificate_generator: specs/checks/gram_general_v2c_emit.py
+  controls_script: specs/checks/gram_general_v2c_controls.py
+  closed_form: >
+    gramGen N g L C e p = Σ_{A ⊆ D} Σ_{B ⊆ D \ A} (−1)^{|B|} Σ_r C(N−|D|, r) Σ_k C(N−|D|−r, k) (−1)^k
+    phiGen(A, B, |A| + r, |B| + k), D = supp e; phiGen sums over exponent vectors t ≤ e the
+    coefficients ∏ C(eᵢ, tᵢ) (g·[i ∈ A ∪ B])^{eᵢ−tᵢ} times the two-group value twoGroupW with
+    exponent totals Σ_A t, Σ_{Aᶜ} t and weight ∏ tᵢ!.
+  generator_specification: >
+    ∫_{T̃} gen a qs · gen a' qs' = Σ_{φ : Fin |qs ++ qs'| → Fin 45} gramGen 45 g (53/50) C
+    (expo (qs ++ qs') φ) (a + a'), with expo qs φ i = Σ_{j : φ j = i} qs[j]: every product of power
+    sums is a sum of monomials indexed by placements of its parts (prod_power_sums).
+  worked_example:
+    entry: "I_T[(1, (2)), (0, (2))] = ∫_{T̃} gen 1 {2} · gen 0 {2} = ∫_{T̃} (L − P₁) P₂²"
+    decomposition: "45 · ∫ (L − Σx) x₀⁴ + 45·44 · ∫ (L − Σx) x₀² x₁² (placements φ with φ₀ = φ₁, φ₀ ≠ φ₁; symmetry by gramGen_perm; transport by gramGen_extend)"
+    value: "gramExampleQ ≈ 5.45080819523255 × 10⁻⁶⁰ (exact rational in gram_entry_example_value)"
+    independent_checks: "both closed forms equal V2a's exploratory moment computation exactly (∫ (L − Σx)x₀⁴ = L m(4) − m(5) − 44 m(4,1); ∫ (L − Σx)x₀²x₁² = L m(2,2) − 2 m(3,2) − 43 m(2,2,1))"
